Description:
HIPO PTE. LTD. is a Singaporean internet company that specializes in social products. The company's flagship product is the Hi Po App, a social app that allows you to quickly match with people you like and enjoy real-time voice chat and interaction. Hi Po is becoming increasingly popular among young people and has become one of the most popular ways to make friends in the Philippines.
With Hi Po, you can:
Accurately and efficiently match with people you like and build valuable relationships;
Take personality tests to find your soul mate and choose from a variety of interactive modes;
Participate in fun interactive games and receive gifts to increase intimacy between the two of you;
Browse posts in your city to find interesting people and things around you.
Hi Po has many more fun features waiting for you to explore. More importantly, it represents a new and interesting social trend. In the future, we will cover more countries and regions with high-quality social products and social games, providing more users with efficient and convenient ways to make friends and services.
